            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Arma 0.8.223 preview.

- Check for Updates works: Arma finds and installs new releases on its own from this version on.
- Servo is left out of this preview while it is made stable. Tabs, site rules and defaults set to Servo open in Chromium.
- Open a Quick Window from any app with its shortcut.
- Notices, status colours and controls are shared across Arma.
- Brings in the latest Crest changes.
]]></description>
